"setuptools/issues/4706>`_)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../NEWS (links).rst:361
msgid ""
"Store ``License-File``\\s in ``.dist-info/licenses`` subfolder and added "
"support for recursive globs for ``license_files`` (PEP :pep:`639 <639#add-"
"license-expression-field>`). -- by :user:`cdce8p` (`#4728 <https://github."
"com/pypa/setuptools/issues/4728>`_)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../NEWS (links).rst:362
msgid ""
"Bump core metadata version to ``2.4``\\. -- by :user:`cdce8p` (`#4830 "
