#: ../../../../NEWS (links).rst:1854
msgid ""
"`#3380 <https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/3380>`_: Passing some "
"types of parameters via ``--global-option`` to setuptools `PEP 517 <https://"
"peps.python.org/pep-0517/>`_/`PEP 660 <https://peps.python.org/pep-0660/>`_ "
"backend is now considered deprecated. The user can pass the same arbitrary "
"parameter via ``--build-option`` (``--global-option`` is now reserved for "
"flags like ``--verbose`` or ``--quiet``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../NEWS (links).rst:1859
msgid ""
