"case matches exactly. As a result, on Windows and other case-insensitive "
"file systems, files with names such as 'readme.txt' or 'README.TXT' will be "
"omitted from the distribution and a warning will be issued indicating that "
"'README.txt' was not found. Other filenames affected are:"
msgstr ""

